{"id":"02b34261c2cb199c","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-first-incompleteness.md","title":"Gödel's First Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-first-incompleteness — Gödel's First Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-first-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-first-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-first-incompleteness — Gödel's First Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 61–63，Theorem 3（PDF 78–80）","source_status":"原书定理的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-first-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-first-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-first-incompleteness — Gödel's First Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 61–63，Theorem 3（PDF 78–80）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书定理的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (omega consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (effectivity and arithmetic-strength conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}first\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(G\\nvdash\\gamma\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\gamma\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}first\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(G\\nvdash\\gamma\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\gamma\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_G\">\\(\\varphi_G\\)</span> : Gödel句子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> : 可证关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li>Gödel第一不完备性定理：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致系统存在不可判定句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性按定义已经蕴含普通相容性，所以不再重复列出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>前提</li>\n<li>有效证明算术化和足够算术强度仍是独立前提；“Rosser只需普通一致性”只替换一致性强度，不删除它们</li>\n<li>Rosser版本只需普通一致性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\gamma\">\\(G\\vdash\\gamma\\)</span>，固定点给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\)</span>；取其真实证明码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，由选定证明公式的正数码验证和存在引入又得内部可证性，违背一致性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\neg\\gamma\">\\(G\\vdash\\neg\\gamma\\)</span>，固定点推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\exists v_1\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\exists v_1\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\)</span> 的相应实例；第一部分保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 没有外部证明，所以每个标准证明码的负实例均可证，违背 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 一致性。普通一致性只支撑第一侧；Rosser 构造另行支撑第二侧。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 61–63，Theorem 3（PDF 78–80）。</p>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id"