stency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}$ : $\\omega$一致性 (see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}first\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(G\\nvdash\\gamma\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\gamma\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\neg\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\exists v_1\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2769,"backlinks":[{"id":"916836dbb5b34f34","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]、[[92-lem-omega-enumeration]]与[[92-df-omega-consistency]]给出原书关于表示和 $\\omega$ 相容性的契约。本地固定 PA 的对应结果见[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]与[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"3402731b38b2c005","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["e0eabee5d77258a7","b823f18a7fc28400","c7befd96bd551ade","b15ebe94f199828c","360e00ddf38f0f16","468d35690d25ee42","975b3aa9a1e08797","0a1ba58f66cc8d4e"]}